    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Immunohistochemical profile of phosphaturic mesenchymal tumours (PMTs) <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{31301876; 14707860; 28614212; 30206408; 24060005; 28858396}</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
